Maaf.

771
01:01:22,637 --> 01:01:24,222
Jangan lupa
hapus riasanmu.

772
01:01:25,264 --> 01:01:26,849
Peraturan rumah.

773
01:01:28,059 --> 01:01:29,727
Kau tahu bagaimana sikap Ayah.

774
01:01:40,988 --> 01:01:42,782
Kau punya
ghost shirt itu, kan?

775
01:01:42,865 --> 01:01:44,409
Apakah dia mati?

776
01:01:44,492 --> 01:01:47,286
